<title>SINGAPORE: TAIWAN TENDERS TO BUY OCTOBER 1-31 NAPHTHA.</title>
<headline>TAIWAN TENDERS TO BUY OCTOBER 1-31 NAPHTHA.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy 30,000 tonnes of full range naphtha for delivery between October 1-31, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender which seeks the cargo to be delivered to Kaoshiung, closes August 20 and is valid for two days.</p>
<p>CPC's last full range naphtha tender, for September 1-10 delivery was awarded to South Korean refiner Yukong Ltd at $203 per tonne on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis, industry sources said.</p>
